keywords:
  - llm
  - model-routing
  - cost-optimization
  - hermes-agent
  - value-leaderboard
abstract: "A Hermes Agent llm_request middleware that classifies each turn (routine vs strategic) and routes it to the cheapest adequate model tier - downgrade to the provider's free rung or escalate to premium - with a fail-open contract, shadow-by-default rollout, credit-aware escalation that fails closed, and per-provider rungs derived from a live value leaderboard feed rather than hardcoded model ids."
